{% comment %}
  Offer landing page for campaign collections (templates/collection.back2school.json,
  templates/collection.oferta.json).

  - Hero: a large photo (picked in the editor, or the deepest deal's with a caption),
    the campaign title, "up to -X%" computed from the products actually shown and a
    countdown to the end date.
  - The campaign's categories as tiles linking to their pages on the site.
  - The offers: one grid with category chips, or one block per category (setting
    "layout"); sorting either way (assets/alc-offer-page.js, cards: snippets/alc-offer-card).
  - "Explore all categories": the store's main categories, picked in the editor.

  Products: every product of the campaign collection, in this order: in-stock offers,
  in-stock products at full price, then the offers of the campaign's categories (collection
  metafield custom.slider_subcollections, or the "Campaign categories" setting), and the
  campaign's sold-out products at the very end. From each category
  snippets/alc-campaign-picker.liquid adds only discounted, in-stock products.
  The whole section runs inside paginate: without it Liquid only hands a loop the first 50
  products of a collection, and a bigger campaign silently lost the rest. 250 is the
  largest page Shopify allows, so a campaign can list up to 250 products.

  Texts have built-in translations for every storefront language; filled-in settings
  override them. Styles: assets/alc-offer-page.css.
{% endcomment %}
{{ 'alc-offer-page.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<script src="{{ 'alc-offer-page.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
{%- comment -%}
  The cards' add-to-cart forms need Dawn's product-form (AJAX add + cart drawer) and
  quick-add (options modal for multi-variant products), like the collection grid loads.
{%- endcomment -%}
<script src="{{ 'product-form.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
<script src="{{ 'quick-add.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>

{%- paginate collection.products by 250 -%}
{%- liquid
  assign lang = request.locale.iso_code | downcase | slice: 0, 2
  case lang
    when 'en'
      assign w = 'Limited offer|Up to|off|Our selection at the best prices, for a limited time only.|Offer ends in|days|hours|min|sec|See the deals|All|Sort by|Biggest discount|Price, low to high|Price, high to low|Offer valid until {date}, while stocks last.|This offer has ended|Products on offer|Recommended|Deals by category|View category|All deals|biggest saving|Shop now|Explore all categories|More than deals: discover the full Alessandro Design range.'
    when 'hu'
      assign w = 'Korlátozott ajánlat|Akár|kedvezmény|Válogatott termékek a legjobb áron, csak korlátozott ideig.|Az ajánlat vége:|nap|óra|perc|mp|Az ajánlatok|Mind|Rendezés|Legnagyobb kedvezmény|Ár szerint növekvő|Ár szerint csökkenő|Az ajánlat {date}-ig érvényes, a készlet erejéig.|Az ajánlat lejárt|Akciós termékek|Ajánlott|Ajánlatok kategóriánként|Kategória megtekintése|Összes ajánlat|legnagyobb megtakarítás|Megveszem|Összes kategória|Az ajánlatokon túl: fedezze fel a teljes Alessandro Design kínálatot.'
    when 'pl'
      assign w = 'Oferta ograniczona|Do|rabatu|Wybrane produkty w najlepszych cenach, tylko przez ograniczony czas.|Oferta kończy się za|dni|godz.|min|sek|Zobacz oferty|Wszystkie|Sortuj|Największy rabat|Cena rosnąco|Cena malejąco|Oferta ważna do {date} lub do wyczerpania zapasów.|Oferta zakończona|Produkty w promocji|Polecane|Oferty według kategorii|Zobacz kategorię|Wszystkie oferty|największa oszczędność|Kup teraz|Wszystkie kategorie|Nie tylko oferty: odkryj pełną ofertę Alessandro Design.'
    when 'el'
      assign w = 'Περιορισμένη προσφορά|Έως|έκπτωση|Επιλεγμένα προϊόντα στις καλύτερες τιμές, μόνο για περιορισμένο χρόνο.|Η προσφορά λήγει σε|ημέρες|ώρες|λεπτά|δευτ.|Δείτε τις προσφορές|Όλα|Ταξινόμηση|Μεγαλύτερη έκπτωση|Τιμή αύξουσα|Τιμή φθίνουσα|Η προσφορά ισχύει έως {date}, έως εξαντλήσεως των αποθεμάτων.|Η προσφορά έληξε|Προϊόντα σε προσφορά|Προτεινόμενα|Προσφορές ανά κατηγορία|Δείτε την κατηγορία|Όλες οι προσφορές|μεγαλύτερη εξοικονόμηση|Αγοράστε τώρα|Όλες οι κατηγορίες|Πέρα από τις προσφορές: ανακαλύψτε όλη τη σειρά Alessandro Design.'
    when 'bg'
      assign w = 'Ограничена оферта|До|отстъпка|Избрани продукти на най-добри цени, само за ограничено време.|Офертата изтича след|дни|часа|мин|сек|Вижте офертите|Всички|Сортиране|Най-голяма отстъпка|Цена възходящо|Цена низходящо|Офертата е валидна до {date} или до изчерпване на количествата.|Офертата приключи|Продукти в промоция|Препоръчани|Оферти по категории|Вижте категорията|Всички оферти|най-голямо спестяване|Купете сега|Всички категории|Не само оферти: разгледайте цялата гама на Alessandro Design.'
    when 'it'
      assign w = 'Offerta limitata|Fino al|di sconto|Prodotti selezionati ai prezzi migliori, solo per un periodo limitato.|L’offerta termina tra|giorni|ore|min|sec|Vedi le offerte|Tutti|Ordina per|Sconto maggiore|Prezzo crescente|Prezzo decrescente|Offerta valida fino al {date}, fino a esaurimento scorte.|L’offerta è terminata|Prodotti in offerta|Consigliati|Offerte per categoria|Vedi la categoria|Tutte le offerte|risparmio massimo|Acquista ora|Tutte le categorie|Non solo offerte: scopri tutta la gamma Alessandro Design.'
    when 'fr'
      assign w = 'Offre limitée|Jusqu’à|de remise|Une sélection aux meilleurs prix, pour une durée limitée.|L’offre se termine dans|jours|h|min|s|Voir les offres|Tous|Trier par|Plus forte remise|Prix croissant|Prix décroissant|Offre valable jusqu’au {date}, dans la limite des stocks disponibles.|L’offre est terminée|Produits en promotion|Recommandés|Offres par catégorie|Voir la catégorie|Toutes les offres|économie maximale|Acheter|Toutes les catégories|Au-delà des offres : découvrez toute la gamme Alessandro Design.'
    when 'cs'
      assign w = 'Omezená nabídka|Až|sleva|Vybrané produkty za nejlepší ceny, jen po omezenou dobu.|Nabídka končí za|dní|hod|min|s|Zobrazit nabídky|Vše|Seřadit|Největší sleva|Cena vzestupně|Cena sestupně|Nabídka platí do {date} nebo do vyprodání zásob.|Nabídka skončila|Produkty v akci|Doporučené|Nabídky podle kategorií|Zobrazit kategorii|Všechny nabídky|největší úspora|Koupit|Všechny kategorie|Nejen nabídky: objevte celý sortiment Alessandro Design.'
    when 'sk'
      assign w = 'Obmedzená ponuka|Až|zľava|Vybrané produkty za najlepšie ceny, len na obmedzený čas.|Ponuka končí o|dní|hod|min|s|Zobraziť ponuky|Všetko|Zoradiť|Najväčšia zľava|Cena vzostupne|Cena zostupne|Ponuka platí do {date} alebo do vypredania zásob.|Ponuka sa skončila|Produkty v akcii|Odporúčané|Ponuky podľa kategórií|Zobraziť kategóriu|Všetky ponuky|najväčšia úspora|Kúpiť|Všetky kategórie|Nielen ponuky: objavte celý sortiment Alessandro Design.'
    when 'hr'
      assign w = 'Ograničena ponuda|Do|popusta|Odabrani proizvodi po najboljim cijenama, samo ograničeno vrijeme.|Ponuda završava za|dana|sati|min|sek|Pogledajte ponude|Sve|Poredaj|Najveći popust|Cijena uzlazno|Cijena silazno|Ponuda vrijedi do {date} ili do isteka zaliha.|Ponuda je završila|Proizvodi na akciji|Preporučeno|Ponude po kategorijama|Pogledajte kategoriju|Sve ponude|najveća ušteda|Kupi sada|Sve kategorije|Ne samo ponude: otkrijte cijeli asortiman Alessandro Design.'
    when 'de'
      assign w = 'Begrenztes Angebot|Bis zu|Rabatt|Ausgewählte Produkte zu den besten Preisen, nur für kurze Zeit.|Angebot endet in|Tage|Std.|Min.|Sek.|Angebote ansehen|Alle|Sortieren|Höchster Rabatt|Preis aufsteigend|Preis absteigend|Angebot gültig bis {date}, solange der Vorrat reicht.|Das Angebot ist beendet|Produkte im Angebot|Empfohlen|Angebote nach Kategorie|Kategorie ansehen|Alle Angebote|größte Ersparnis|Jetzt kaufen|Alle Kategorien|Mehr als Angebote: Entdecken Sie das ganze Sortiment von Alessandro Design.'
    else
      assign w = 'Ofertă limitată|Până la|reducere|Produse selectate la cele mai bune prețuri, doar pentru o perioadă limitată.|Oferta se încheie în|zile|ore|min|sec|Vezi ofertele|Toate|Sortează după|Reducere maximă|Preț crescător|Preț descrescător|Ofertă valabilă până pe {date}, în limita stocului.|Oferta s-a încheiat|Produse la ofertă|Recomandate|Oferte pe categorii|Vezi categoria|Toate ofertele|economie maximă|Cumpără acum|Explorează toate categoriile|Mai mult decât oferte: descoperă întreaga gamă Alessandro Design.'
  endcase
  assign t = w | split: '|'

  assign end_date = section.settings.end_date | strip

  comment
    The campaign's categories: the setting, else the collection metafield, else the
    collection itself.
  endcomment
  assign source_handles = ''
  assign category_list = section.settings.categories
  if category_list.size == 0
    assign category_list = collection.metafields.custom.slider_subcollections.value
  endif
  for sub in category_list
    assign source_handles = source_handles | append: sub.handle | append: ','
  endfor
  if source_handles == ''
    assign source_handles = collection.handle
  endif
  assign source_handles = source_handles | split: ','

  comment
    Rows, one per card: "<100 - discount><pick order>~<product id>~<category>~<source>".
    The category is the first campaign category the product belongs to (for the chips);
    the source is the collection it came from. Every row gets its product object in
    row_products at the same index, so nothing has to be looked up again later.

    1. Every product of the campaign collection. Key "<group><6 digits>~<id>", sorted
       descending: in-stock offers (group 3) and full price (group 2) with the most stock
       first, like the picker; sold out (group 1) in the collection's own order.
  endcomment
  assign camp_keys = ''
  for p in collection.products
    assign stock = 0
    for variant in p.variants
      if variant.inventory_management == blank
        assign stock = stock | plus: 999
      elsif variant.inventory_quantity > 0
        assign stock = stock | plus: variant.inventory_quantity
      endif
    endfor
    if stock > 999999
      assign stock = 999999
    endif
    if p.available == false
      assign tier = '1'
      assign stock = 999999 | minus: forloop.index0
    elsif p.compare_at_price > p.price
      assign tier = '3'
    else
      assign tier = '2'
    endif
    assign padded_stock = stock | plus: 1000000 | append: '' | slice: 1, 6
    assign camp_keys = camp_keys | append: tier | append: padded_stock | append: '~' | append: p.id | append: ','
  endfor
  assign camp_keys = camp_keys | split: ',' | sort | reverse

  assign no_products = '' | split: ','
  assign shown_ids = ','
  assign order = 0
  assign deal_rows = ''
  assign rows_offer = ''
  assign rows_full = ''
  assign rows_sold = ''
  assign rows_extra = ''
  assign products_offer = no_products
  assign products_full = no_products
  assign products_sold = no_products
  assign products_extra = no_products
  for key in camp_keys
    assign wanted_id = key | split: '~' | last | plus: 0
    assign found = collection.products | where: 'id', wanted_id
    if found.size == 0
      continue
    endif
    assign p = found.first
    assign pct = 0
    if p.compare_at_price > p.price
      assign pct = p.compare_at_price | minus: p.price | times: 100.0 | divided_by: p.compare_at_price | round
    endif
    assign inv = 100 | minus: pct | plus: 1000 | append: '' | slice: 1, 3
    assign ord = order | plus: 1000 | append: '' | slice: 1, 3
    assign cat = collection.handle
    assign p_handles = p.collections | map: 'handle'
    for h in source_handles
      if p_handles contains h
        assign cat = h
        break
      endif
    endfor
    assign row = inv | append: ord | append: '~' | append: p.id | append: '~' | append: cat | append: '~' | append: collection.handle | append: ','
    assign tier = key | slice: 0
    case tier
      when '3'
        assign rows_offer = rows_offer | append: row
        assign products_offer = products_offer | concat: found
        assign deal_rows = deal_rows | append: row
      when '2'
        assign rows_full = rows_full | append: row
        assign products_full = products_full | concat: found
      else
        assign rows_sold = rows_sold | append: row
        assign products_sold = products_sold | concat: found
    endcase
    assign shown_ids = shown_ids | append: p.id | append: ','
    assign order = order | plus: 1
  endfor

  comment
    2. The categories top the page up with their own discounted, in-stock products
       ("Offers per category" each, from the first 50 products of each category).
  endcomment
  for pass_handle in source_handles
    if pass_handle == collection.handle
      continue
    endif
    assign source = collections[pass_handle]
    if source == blank
      continue
    endif
    capture picked
      render 'alc-campaign-picker', source: source, campaign: collection, slots: section.settings.slots, exclude: shown_ids, no_fill: true
    endcapture
    assign picked_ids = picked | strip | split: ','
    for picked_id in picked_ids
      assign wanted_id = picked_id | plus: 0
      assign found = source.products | where: 'id', wanted_id
      if found.size == 0
        continue
      endif
      assign p = found.first
      assign pct = p.compare_at_price | minus: p.price | times: 100.0 | divided_by: p.compare_at_price | round
      assign inv = 100 | minus: pct | plus: 1000 | append: '' | slice: 1, 3
      assign ord = order | plus: 1000 | append: '' | slice: 1, 3
      assign row = inv | append: ord | append: '~' | append: p.id | append: '~' | append: pass_handle | append: '~' | append: pass_handle | append: ','
      assign rows_extra = rows_extra | append: row
      assign products_extra = products_extra | concat: found
      assign deal_rows = deal_rows | append: row
      assign shown_ids = shown_ids | append: p.id | append: ','
      assign order = order | plus: 1
    endfor
  endfor

  comment
    Page order: the campaign's own products (offers, then full price), the category
    offers, and the campaign's sold-out products last. "ranked" holds only the real
    offers (in stock, discounted), deepest discount first, for the hero and the tiles.
  endcomment
  assign rows = rows_offer | append: rows_full | append: rows_extra | append: rows_sold
  assign row_products = products_offer | concat: products_full | concat: products_extra | concat: products_sold
  assign picked_rows = rows | split: ','
  assign offer_count = picked_rows.size
  assign ranked = deal_rows | split: ',' | sort

  comment
    Hero: the best deal of each category first, then the next best overall.
  endcomment
  assign top_rows = ''
  assign top_cats = ','
  for row in ranked
    assign parts = row | split: '~'
    assign cat_token = ',' | append: parts[2] | append: ','
    unless top_cats contains cat_token
      assign top_rows = top_rows | append: row | append: ','
      assign top_cats = top_cats | append: parts[2] | append: ','
    endunless
  endfor
  for row in ranked
    unless top_rows contains row
      assign top_rows = top_rows | append: row | append: ','
    endunless
  endfor
  assign top_rows = top_rows | split: ','
-%}

<div class="alc-of" style="--alc-of-accent: {{ section.settings.accent }};">
  {%- comment -%} Hero {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="alc-of__hero">
    {%- liquid
      comment
        Hero picture: the one chosen in the editor, otherwise the photo of the deepest
        deal, which then gets a small caption linking to it.
      endcomment
      assign spot = nil
      if top_rows.size > 0
        assign parts = top_rows.first | split: '~'
        assign wanted_id = parts[1] | plus: 0
        assign spot_pct = parts[0] | slice: 0, 3 | plus: 0
        assign spot_pct = 100 | minus: spot_pct
        assign spot = row_products | where: 'id', wanted_id | first
      endif
      assign hero_img = section.settings.hero_image
      assign show_caption = false
      if hero_img == blank and spot != nil
        assign hero_img = spot.featured_image
        assign show_caption = true
      endif
      assign max_pct = 0
      if ranked.size > 0
        assign first_key = ranked.first | split: '~' | first | slice: 0, 3 | plus: 0
        assign max_pct = 100 | minus: first_key
      endif
    -%}
    {%- if hero_img != blank -%}
      <div class="alc-of__hero-media">
        {{
          hero_img
          | image_url: width: 2000
          | image_tag:
            widths: '600, 900, 1200, 1600, 2000',
            sizes: '(min-width: 750px) 65vw, 100vw',
            loading: 'eager',
            fetchpriority: 'high',
            alt: '',
            class: 'alc-of__hero-img'
        }}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    <div class="page-width alc-of__hero-inner">
      <div class="alc-of__hero-copy">
        <p class="alc-of__eyebrow">
          <span class="alc-of__pulse" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          {{ t[0] }}
        </p>
        <h1 class="alc-of__title">{{ section.settings.heading | default: collection.title | escape }}</h1>

        {%- if max_pct > 0 -%}
          <p class="alc-of__deal">
            <span class="alc-of__deal-pre">{{ t[1] }}</span>
            <span class="alc-of__deal-pct">-{{ max_pct }}%</span>
            <span class="alc-of__deal-post">{{ t[2] }}</span>
          </p>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if end_date != blank -%}
          <alc-offer-countdown class="alc-of__countdown is-pending" data-end="{{ end_date | escape }}">
            <p class="alc-of__countdown-label">{{ t[4] }}</p>
            <div class="alc-of__clock" role="timer" aria-live="off">
              <span class="alc-of__unit"><b data-d>0</b><small>{{ t[5] }}</small></span>
              <span class="alc-of__sep" aria-hidden="true">:</span>
              <span class="alc-of__unit"><b data-h>00</b><small>{{ t[6] }}</small></span>
              <span class="alc-of__sep" aria-hidden="true">:</span>
              <span class="alc-of__unit"><b data-m>00</b><small>{{ t[7] }}</small></span>
              <span class="alc-of__sep" aria-hidden="true">:</span>
              <span class="alc-of__unit"><b data-s>00</b><small>{{ t[8] }}</small></span>
            </div>
            <p class="alc-of__ended" data-ended hidden>{{ t[16] }}</p>
          </alc-offer-countdown>
        {%- endif -%}

        <a class="alc-of__cta" href="#AlcOffers">
          {{- t[9] -}}
          <svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 5v14M6 13l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    {%- if show_caption and section.settings.show_top_deals -%}
      <a class="alc-of__caption" href="{{ spot.url }}">
        <span class="alc-of__caption-pct">-{{ spot_pct }}%</span>
        <span class="alc-of__caption-text">
          <span class="alc-of__caption-name">{{ spot.title | escape }}</span>
          <span class="alc-of__caption-price">{{ spot.price | money }} <s>{{ spot.compare_at_price | money }}</s></span>
        </span>
        <svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
      </a>
    {%- endif -%}
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} The campaign's categories, each linking to its page on the site. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if source_handles.size > 1 or source_handles.first != collection.handle -%}
    <section class="page-width alc-of__cats-wrap">
      <h2 class="alc-of__h2">{{ t[19] }}</h2>
      <ul class="alc-of__cats" role="list">
        {%- for source_handle in source_handles -%}
          {%- liquid
            comment
              The category's best offer gives the "up to" figure; a category holding only
              full-price or sold-out campaign products keeps its tile without one.
            endcomment
            assign source = collections[source_handle]
            assign token = '~' | append: source_handle | append: '~'
            assign cat_row = ''
            assign cat_pct = 0
            for row in ranked
              if row contains token
                assign cat_row = row
                assign cat_pct = row | slice: 0, 3 | plus: 0
                assign cat_pct = 100 | minus: cat_pct
                break
              endif
            endfor
            if cat_row == ''
              for row in picked_rows
                if row contains token
                  assign cat_row = row
                  break
                endif
              endfor
            endif
          -%}
          {%- if source != blank and cat_row != '' -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign parts = cat_row | split: '~'
              assign wanted_id = parts[1] | plus: 0
              comment
                The category's own image (studio cut-outs on white, shown on a warm ground
                with multiply); the first offer's photo when the category has none.
              endcomment
              assign cat_img = source.image
              if cat_img == blank
                assign cat_product = row_products | where: 'id', wanted_id | first
                assign cat_img = cat_product.featured_image
              endif
            -%}
            <li>
              <a class="alc-of__cat" href="{{ source.url }}">
                <span class="alc-of__cat-media">
                  {%- if cat_img != blank -%}
                    {{
                      cat_img
                      | image_url: width: 800
                      | image_tag:
                        widths: '400, 600, 800',
                        sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 30vw, 72vw',
                        loading: 'lazy',
                        alt: '',
                        class: 'alc-of__cat-img'
                    }}
                  {%- endif -%}
                </span>
                <span class="alc-of__cat-body">
                  <span class="alc-of__cat-text">
                    <span class="alc-of__cat-name">{{ source.title | escape }}</span>
                    {%- if cat_pct > 0 -%}
                      <span class="alc-of__cat-pct">{{ t[1] }} -{{ cat_pct }}%</span>
                    {%- endif -%}
                  </span>
                  <span class="alc-of__cat-go" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
                  </span>
                </span>
              </a>
            </li>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    </section>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%} Offers {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign grouped = false
    if section.settings.layout == 'grouped' and source_handles.size > 1
      assign grouped = true
    endif
    comment
      Grouped layout: one block per category, plus the campaign's own products that sit
      in none of them (tagged with the campaign handle) at the end.
    endcomment
    assign group_handles = source_handles | join: ',' | append: ',' | append: collection.handle | split: ','
  -%}
  <section class="page-width alc-of__offers" id="AlcOffers">
    <alc-offer-grid class="alc-of__grid-wrap" data-layout="{% if grouped %}grouped{% else %}grid{% endif %}">
      <h2 class="alc-of__h2">{{ t[21] }}</h2>
      <div class="alc-of__bar">
        <div class="alc-of__chips" role="group" aria-label="{{ t[11] | escape }}">
          {%- unless grouped -%}
            <button type="button" class="alc-of__chip" data-cat="" aria-pressed="true">
              {{- t[10] }} <span class="alc-of__chip-count">{{ offer_count }}</span>
            </button>
          {%- endunless -%}
          {%- for source_handle in source_handles -%}
            {%- assign source = collections[source_handle] -%}
            {%- assign token = '~' | append: source_handle | append: '~' -%}
            {%- assign cat_count = rows | split: token | size | minus: 1 -%}
            {%- if source != blank and cat_count > 0 and source_handles.size > 1 -%}
              {%- if grouped -%}
                <a class="alc-of__chip" href="#AlcGroup-{{ source.handle }}">
                  {{- source.title | escape }} <span class="alc-of__chip-count">{{ cat_count }}</span>
                </a>
              {%- else -%}
                <button type="button" class="alc-of__chip" data-cat="{{ source.handle }}" aria-pressed="false">
                  {{- source.title | escape }} <span class="alc-of__chip-count">{{ cat_count }}</span>
                </button>
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
        <label class="alc-of__sort">
          <span class="alc-of__sort-label">{{ t[11] }}</span>
          <select data-sort>
            <option value="recommended">{{ t[18] }}</option>
            <option value="discount">{{ t[12] }}</option>
            <option value="price-asc">{{ t[13] }}</option>
            <option value="price-desc">{{ t[14] }}</option>
          </select>
        </label>
      </div>

      {%- if grouped -%}
        {%- assign skip_styles = false -%}
        {%- for group_handle in group_handles -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign group = collections[group_handle]
            assign token = '~' | append: group_handle | append: '~'
            assign group_count = rows | split: token | size | minus: 1
            if group == blank or group_count == 0
              continue
            endif
            assign group_pct = 0
            for row in ranked
              if row contains token
                assign group_pct = row | slice: 0, 3 | plus: 0
                assign group_pct = 100 | minus: group_pct
                break
              endif
            endfor
          -%}
          <div class="alc-of__group" id="AlcGroup-{{ group_handle }}">
            <div class="alc-of__group-head">
              <h3 class="alc-of__group-title">
                {{- group.title | escape -}}
                {%- if group_pct > 0 %} <span class="alc-of__group-pct">{{ t[1] }} -{{ group_pct }}%</span>{% endif -%}
              </h3>
              {%- if group_handle != collection.handle -%}
                <a class="alc-of__group-link" href="{{ group.url }}">
                  {{- t[20] -}}
                  <svg aria-hidden="true" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
                </a>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
            <ul class="grid product-grid grid--2-col-tablet-down grid--4-col-desktop alc-of__grid" role="list" data-grid>
              {%- assign position = 0 -%}
              {%- for row in picked_rows -%}
                {%- if row contains token -%}
                  {%- assign offer_product = row_products[forloop.index0] -%}
                  {%- render 'alc-offer-card', row: row, product: offer_product, position: position, wide_cards: section.settings.wide_cards, section_id: section.id, skip_styles: skip_styles -%}
                  {%- assign skip_styles = true -%}
                  {%- assign position = position | plus: 1 -%}
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
            </ul>
          </div>
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- else -%}
        <ul class="grid product-grid grid--2-col-tablet-down grid--4-col-desktop alc-of__grid" role="list" data-grid>
          {%- for row in picked_rows -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign skip_styles = true
              if forloop.first
                assign skip_styles = false
              endif
              assign offer_product = row_products[forloop.index0]
            -%}
            {%- render 'alc-offer-card', row: row, product: offer_product, position: forloop.index0, wide_cards: section.settings.wide_cards, section_id: section.id, skip_styles: skip_styles -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ul>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if end_date != blank -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign end_numeric = end_date | date: '%d.%m.%Y'
          comment
            A literal "{date}" inside an output tag would close it early, so the token is built.
          endcomment
          assign date_token = '{' | append: 'date' | append: '}'
          assign terms_text = t[15] | replace: date_token, end_numeric
        -%}
        <p class="alc-of__terms" data-terms data-date="{{ end_date | escape }}">{{ terms_text }}</p>
        <template data-terms-template>{{ t[15] }}</template>
      {%- endif -%}
    </alc-offer-grid>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} The rest of the store, picked in the editor. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if section.settings.more_collections.size > 0 -%}
    <section class="page-width alc-of__more">
      <div class="alc-of__more-head">
        <h2 class="alc-of__h2">{{ t[24] }}</h2>
        <p class="alc-of__more-text">{{ t[25] }}</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="alc-of__more-list" role="list">
        {%- for c in section.settings.more_collections -%}
          <li>
            <a class="alc-of__more-item" href="{{ c.url }}">
              <span class="alc-of__more-media">
                {%- assign more_img = c.image | default: c.products.first.featured_image -%}
                {%- if more_img != blank -%}
                  {{
                    more_img
                    | image_url: width: 400
                    | image_tag:
                      widths: '200, 300, 400',
                      sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 180px, 40vw',
                      loading: 'lazy',
                      alt: ''
                  }}
                {%- endif -%}
              </span>
              <span class="alc-of__more-name">{{ c.title | escape }}</span>
            </a>
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    </section>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%} ItemList for the products on the page, in page order. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if row_products.size > 0 -%}
    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "ItemList",
        "name": {{ collection.title | json }},
        "numberOfItems": {{ row_products.size }},
        "itemListElement": [
          {%- for p in row_products -%}
            {%- unless forloop.first %},{% endunless %}
            { "@type": "ListItem", "position": {{ forloop.index }}, "url": {{ request.origin | append: p.url | json }}, "name": {{ p.title | json }} }
          {%- endfor -%}
        ]
      }
    </script>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>
{%- endpaginate -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Offer page",
  "tag": "div",
  "class": "section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "Lists every product of the campaign collection (up to 250): in-stock offers, then full price, sold out last. The categories (collection metafield custom.slider_subcollections, or the setting below) add their own discounted, in-stock products." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "end_date", "label": "Offer end date", "info": "YYYY-MM-DD. The countdown runs to 23:59 Bucharest time. Leave empty to hide it." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "info": "Empty: the collection title" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "hero_image", "label": "Hero image", "info": "Empty: the photo of the deepest deal, with a caption linking to it" },
    { "type": "collection_list", "id": "categories", "label": "Campaign categories", "limit": 8, "info": "Empty: the collection metafield custom.slider_subcollections. Offers are picked from the campaign collection first, then from these." },
    { "type": "color", "id": "accent", "label": "Accent colour", "default": "#e8732c" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "slots", "min": 4, "max": 30, "step": 1, "label": "Offers per category", "default": 15 },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_top_deals", "label": "Caption with the deepest deal on the hero photo", "default": true },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "wide_cards", "label": "Wide highlight cards in the grid (desktop)", "default": true },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "layout",
      "label": "Offers layout",
      "options": [
        { "value": "grid", "label": "One grid with category filters" },
        { "value": "grouped", "label": "One block per category" }
      ],
      "default": "grid"
    },
    { "type": "collection_list", "id": "more_collections", "label": "Explore the store: categories", "limit": 12, "info": "Shown under the offers, linking to the category pages" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Offer page" }]
}
{% endschema %}
